### 1. Cek Daftar Menu (GET - Publik, Tanpa Login)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/menus
Accept: application/json

### 2. Cek Daftar Transaksi Sebelum Login (Harusnya 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/transactions
Accept: application/json

### 3. Register Akun Customer
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "Budi Pembeli",
    "email": "budi2@warteg.com",
    "password": "password123",
    "role": "customer"
}

### 4. Cek Profil User yang Login (Harusnya muncul Budi dengan role customer)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/me
Accept: application/json

### 5. Customer Beli Makanan / Transaksi Baru (Harusnya 201 Created)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "menu_id": 1,
    "quantity": 2
}

### 6. Customer Coba Akses Daftar Semua Transaksi (Harusnya 403 Forbidden!)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/transactions
Accept: application/json

### 7. Logout Customer
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/logout
Accept: application/json

### 8. Register Akun Admin/Kasir
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "Admin Warteg",
    "email": "admin@warteg.com",
    "password": "password123",
    "role": "admin"
}

### 9. Admin Akses Daftar Semua Transaksi (Harusnya 200 OK!)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/transactions
Accept: application/json

